<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was an adopted child. On a stormy night, a rat couple found [PAWN_nameDef] abandoned by the roadside. Despite being local celebrities and already having a daughter, and despite [PAWN_pronoun] is not being ratkin, they adopted [PAWN_nameDef]—an act considered a defilement of their pure faith by the fanatical and xenophobic Diurganate Community. To survive in the Diurganate's xenophobic environment, the couple provided him with lifelike fake ears and a fake tail, and sent their daughter outside to protect [PAWN_pronoun]. The child who should have died in the stormy night finally found a warm home. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Adopted_Child.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是一名被收养的孩子。在某个风雨交加的夜晚，一对鼠族夫妇在路边看到了被遗弃的[PAWN_nameDef]，尽管她们是当地名流并且已经有一位女儿，[PAWN_pronoun]也不是鼠族，但是她们依然收养了[PAWN_nameDef]——对于狂热排外的双尾教国，这种行为是对信仰纯粹的玷污。为了在双尾教国的排外环境下生活，这对夫妇为其准备了栩栩如生的假耳朵和假尾巴，并让自己的女儿在外面保护[PAWN_possessive]，那个本该在风雨夜中死去的孩子，最终得到了一个温暖的家。</DD_Ratkin_Adopted_Child.description>
  <!-- EN: Adopted Ratkin Child -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Adopted_Child.title>弃子</DD_Ratkin_Adopted_Child.title>
  <!-- EN: Adopted Child -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Adopted_Child.titleShort>弃子</DD_Ratkin_Adopted_Child.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: Upon reaching adulthood, [PAWN_nameDef] became an exorcist for the Twin-Tail community enforcer authorized by the Catholic Church, responsible for eliminating evil and maintaining order in the church and surrounding area. [PAWN_pronoun] was always dedicated and deeply loved by the congregation, until one day, during a fight with thugs, [PAWN_possessive] accidentally lost hairpin. Those once praising and admiring gazes instantly turned sinister and vicious, cursing this alien who had deceived the ratkins. Ultimately, the church's public trial declared [PAWN_nameDef] exiled from the community. Without anger or protest, [PAWN_pronoun] silently left the home which had once protected. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Exiled_Exorcist.description>成年后，[PAWN_nameDef]成为了一名双尾教国的驱魔人——教廷授权的社区执法者，负责除暴安良，维持教堂和周边地区的秩序。[PAWN_pronoun]一直尽心尽责，深受教众的爱戴，直到有一天，[PAWN_possessive]耳朵发卡在与暴徒的打斗中不慎掉落，那些曾经夸耀和赞美的目光立刻变得阴狠毒辣，并诅咒这个欺骗鼠众的异族。\n\n最终，教堂的公开裁判宣布将[PAWN_nameDef]从社区中放逐出去，没有愤怒也没有抗议，[PAWN_pronoun]一声不响的离开了这个自己曾经守护的家园。</DD_Ratkin_Exiled_Exorcist.description>
  <!-- EN: Exiled Exorcist -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Exiled_Exorcist.title>被放逐的驱魔人</DD_Ratkin_Exiled_Exorcist.title>
  <!-- EN: Exorcist -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Exiled_Exorcist.titleShort>驱魔人</DD_Ratkin_Exiled_Exorcist.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: Upon reaching adulthood, [PAWN_nameDef] became a nun. Disliking the monotonous, mechanical preaching of traditional nuns, [PAWN_nameDef] chose to become an idol, touring the communities of the Twin-Tail, spreading the gospel through song. Young ratkins from far and wide flocked to this novel form of preaching, and [PAWN_possessive] tours were never short of audiences. However, when [PAWN_nameDef] returned home in triumph, [PAWN_pronoun] discovered the entire community had been destroyed. Because the community had banished its exorcist sheriff, some malicious rats and other races colluded to bring forbidden addictive substances into the community. No one stood up to stop it; their former faith was ruthlessly trampled, their parents were murdered by a frenzied mob, and the community had become a haven for addicts. Disappointed, [PAWN_nameDef] left home, embarking once more on [PAWN_possessive] preaching journey, and searching for [PAWN_possessive] lost sister. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Idol_Sister.description>成年后，[PAWN_nameDef]成为了一名修女。[PAWN_nameDef]不喜欢像那些传统修女一样一成不变地机械地布道，而是选择当一名偶像，在双尾教国的社区中巡回出演，以歌声向教众们传播福音。十里八乡的年轻鼠鼠们对这种新奇的布道趋之若鹜，[PAWN_possessive]巡回布道从不缺少观众。\n\n但是，当[PAWN_nameDef]功成名就回到家乡时，才知道整个社区已经毁灭了，由于社区放逐了自己的驱魔人治安官，一些不怀好意的鼠族和异族沆瀣一气，将被禁止的成瘾品带进了社区中。没有人站出来阻止，曾经的信仰被无情践踏，自己的父母被疯狂的人群残害，这个社区就这样变成了瘾君子聚集地。[PAWN_nameDef]失望地离开了家园，再次踏上了布道的旅途，并寻找自己失散的妹妹。</DD_Ratkin_Idol_Sister.description>
  <!-- EN: Idol Sister -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Idol_Sister.title>偶像修女</DD_Ratkin_Idol_Sister.title>
  <!-- EN: Sister -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Idol_Sister.titleShort>偶像修女</DD_Ratkin_Idol_Sister.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a descendant of a prestigious ratkin family. From a young age, [PAWN_nameDef] received an elite education from the church in preparation for taking over the family business. [PAWN_possessive] spent [PAWN_pronoun] childhood immersed in scriptures and elaborate prayers. One day, [PAWN_possessive]'s parents brought home a child without ears or a tail. [PAWN_nameDef] quickly accepted her and loved her like a younger sister. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Nobel_Child.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是一个鼠族名流家族的后代，从小便接受教会的精英教育，以在长大后接管家族的产业，[PAWN_possessive]童年是在经书的海洋和繁杂的祷文中度过的。有一天，[PAWN_possessive]父母带回来一个没有耳朵也没有尾巴的孩子，[PAWN_nameDef]很快接受了她，并把她当成自己的妹妹一样爱护。</DD_Ratkin_Nobel_Child.description>
  <!-- EN: Ratkin Nobel Child -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Nobel_Child.title>贵族长女</DD_Ratkin_Nobel_Child.title>
  <!-- EN: Nobel Child -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Nobel_Child.titleShort>贵族长女</DD_Ratkin_Nobel_Child.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a nun from the Divine Diurganate. Compared to the followers of various folk religions in the Ratkin Kingdom, the followers of the Diurganate are more radical, thus [PAWN_pronoun] is different from the nuns active in other Rat Kingdoms. As the leader of the Diurganate's small group of followers, [PAWN_pronoun] always inspires nearby followers with [PAWN_possessive] passionate spirit and leads them in striving for common goals—whether it's building colonies, holding prayer gatherings, or judging the unbelievers. -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Sister.description>[PAWN_nameDef] 是双尾教国的一名修女。与鼠族王国中各种民间宗教的信徒相比，圣双尾教的信徒更为激进，因此 [PAWN_pronoun] 与其他鼠族王国的修女有所不同。作为神圣双尾教信徒的领袖，[PAWN_pronoun] 总是以她充满激情的精神激励着周围的信徒，并带领他们为共同的目标而奋斗——无论是建立殖民地、聚众祈祷，还是审判异端。</DD_Ratkin_Sister.description>
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Sister -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Sister.title>圣双尾教修女</DD_Ratkin_Sister.title>
  <!-- EN: Sister -->
  <DD_Ratkin_Sister.titleShort>双尾修女</DD_Ratkin_Sister.titleShort>
  
</LanguageData>